Package: echo-search
Version: 1.0.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Echo Project <https://github.com/demid/spotlight_liquidglass>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-gi, python3-gi-cairo, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-gtk4layershell-1.0, libgtk4-layer-shell0, gir1.2-gnomedesktop-4.0, gir1.2-tracker-3.0, python3-rapidfuzz
Recommends: gnome-control-center
Homepage: https://github.com/demid/spotlight_liquidglass
Description: Modern Liquid Glass Spotlight Launcher for Linux (GNOME/Wayland)
 Echo is an ultra-fast, visually stunning Spotlight/Raycast-like launcher
 and productivity hub built natively for Wayland and GNOME with GTK4 and
 gtk4-layer-shell.
 .
 Features:
  * Liquid glass aesthetics with translucent blur and dynamic theme support
  * Lightning fast fuzzy application search with usage ranking
  * Deep file search integrated with GNOME Tracker 3 SPARQL and instant cache
  * Instant inline math expressions and unit conversion
  * Clipboard history manager with rich previews
  * Full emoji and symbol catalog search
  * Rich preview inspector with object pooling
